  "legacy_defects": [
    "a chat read refused 422 for a bad `before` cursor still writes the node's reply incarnation: the mint runs before the cursor check (docket org-reads-that-write-chat-gets-mint-on-first-rea)",
    "the scratch, tool-image and orgmd reads open the file without closing it (a ResourceWarning in the boundary test run), leaving a handle open until collection (same docket)"
  ],
  "scope": "Legacy boundary of the org and agent read routes (P01 F6) on disposable SQLite, the transcript a fixture file. Drives, notices and broadcasts are spies; the routes, the ledger, the chat projection and its sidecars, the scratch folders and the history and event readers are real. Legacy conformance evidence only: not a runtime census, not PostgreSQL or Rust qualification."
}
